## COMMON QUERIES

### Menu
- All categories: App\Models\MenuCategory::where('status','active')->orderBy('display_order')->get(['id','name'])
- Items by category: App\Models\MenuItem::where('category_id',ID)->where('status','available')->get(['id','name','price','description'])
- Search items: App\Models\MenuItem::where('status','available')->where('name','LIKE','%term%')->get(['id','name','price'])
- All available: App\Models\MenuItem::where('status','available')->get(['id','name','price','category_id'])

### Orders
- Create order: App\Models\Order::create(['table_id'=>TID,'guest_id'=>GID,'order_source'=>'whatsapp','status'=>'pending','subtotal'=>0,'tax'=>0,'total'=>0])
- Add item: App\Models\OrderItem::create(['order_id'=>OID,'menu_item_id'=>MID,'quantity'=>QTY,'unit_price'=>PRICE,'subtotal'=>QTY*PRICE,'prep_status'=>'pending'])
- Recalculate total after adding items:
  $o=App\Models\Order::find(OID); $s=$o->orderItems()->sum(DB::raw('quantity*unit_price')); $t=round($s*0.18,2); $o->update(['subtotal'=>$s,'tax'=>$t,'total'=>$s+$t]);
- Update session after order: App\Models\WhatsAppSession::where('phone_number','PHONE')->update(['current_order_id'=>OID])
- Guest's latest order: App\Models\Order::where('guest_id',GID)->latest()->first()
- Order with items: App\Models\Order::where('id',OID)->with('items.menuItem')->first()

### Tables
- Available tables: App\Models\Table::where('status','available')->get(['id','name','capacity','location'])
- Seat party of N: App\Models\Table::where('status','available')->where('capacity','>=',N)->get()

### Reservations
- Create: App\Models\Reservation::create(['guest_id'=>GID,'reservation_date'=>'YYYY-MM-DD','reservation_time'=>'HH:MM','party_size'=>N,'location'=>'indoor','status'=>'confirmed','source'=>'whatsapp'])
- Today's reservations: App\Models\Reservation::where('reservation_date',today())->where('status','!=','cancelled')->get()

### Payments & Bills
- Order bill: App\Models\Order::where('id',OID)->first(['total','subtotal','tax','status'])
- Payment status: App\Models\Payment::where('order_id',OID)->get(['payment_method','amount','status'])

### Kitchen / Bar (for staff queries)
- Pending kitchen: App\Models\OrderItem::whereIn('prep_status',['pending','preparing'])->whereHas('menuItem',fn($q)=>$q->whereIn('prep_area',['kitchen','both']))->with('menuItem:id,name','order:id,order_number,table_id','order.table:id,name')->get()
- Pending bar: App\Models\OrderItem::whereIn('prep_status',['pending','received','preparing'])->whereHas('menuItem',fn($q)=>$q->whereIn('prep_area',['bar','both']))->with('menuItem:id,name','order:id,order_number,table_id','order.table:id,name')->get()

### Reports (for managers)
- Revenue today: App\Models\Payment::whereDate('created_at',today())->where('status','completed')->sum('amount')
- Orders today: App\Models\Order::whereDate('created_at',today())->count()
- Popular items: App\Models\OrderItem::selectRaw('menu_item_id, count(*) as cnt')->groupBy('menu_item_id')->orderByDesc('cnt')->limit(10)->get()
- Active staff: App\Models\Staff::where('status','active')->get(['id','name','role'])
- Low stock: App\Models\MenuItem::where('status','available')->whereColumn('stock_quantity','<','low_stock_threshold')->get(['id','name','stock_quantity','low_stock_threshold'])
